  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 720.06 Confidentiality and Release of Information. Requests from a perpetrator listed on the BAAS state registry for information contained in the paper file shall be limited to the protective investigation summary and the supporting attachments listed therein.\n\nSource. #10191, eff 9-27-12; ss by #13602, eff 3-28-23, EXPIRES: 3-28-33\n\nAPPENDIX",
